WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.539
Attention without regulation is dangerous.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.741
If you walk through that door tight and reactive, the whole room tightens.

3
00:00:08.801 --> 00:00:11.101
But if you carry calm, the room settles.

4
00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:15.361
Leadership is not about volume. It is about composure.

5
00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:19.140
In phase two, we focus on regulation.

6
00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.500
I am going to show you how to set the emotional thermostat.

7
00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.740
We are going to talk about the Floor General.

8
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:30.240
The fifteen minutes at your kids' level that

9
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.480
matter more than five hours you spent around them.
